{"id":247,"date":"2009-11-18T22:09:03","date_gmt":"2009-11-18T22:09:03","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=247"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:21:13","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:21:13","slug":"wireshark-operationnel-sous-w7","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2009\/11\/18\/wireshark-operationnel-sous-w7\/","title":{"rendered":"Wireshark op\u00e9rationnel sous W7"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Wireshark 1.2.4 (stable) has been released &#8211; \u00e7a fait plaisir! Enfin on peut utiliser cet analyseur de r\u00e9seau sous Windows 7. Et il s&rsquo;installe sans coup f\u00e9rir (32 bits &#8211; je n&rsquo;ai plus la 64 bits&#8230;)<\/p>\n<p>En effet, pour le projet \u00ab\u00a0Barrette \u00e9cologique\u00a0\u00bb,\u00a0 j&rsquo;avais besoin de sniffer ce qui se passe entre le module MXBOARD. Jusqu&rsquo;ici, je devais passer par le d\u00e9bugger et voir ainsi les trames re\u00e7ues\/envoy\u00e9es, via ligne s\u00e9rie!<\/p>\n<p>Le but est de trouver une requ\u00eate r\u00e9guli\u00e8re que ferait un PC, pour lancer un timer de prolongation de dur\u00e9e de l&rsquo;enclenchement du secteur.<\/p>\n<p>\/\/Yves<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Wireshark 1.2.4 (stable) has been released &#8211; \u00e7a fait plaisir! Enfin on peut utiliser cet analyseur de r\u00e9seau sous Windows<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[4,20,22,24,37],"class_list":["post-247","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-ecologie","tag-pic","tag-programmation","tag-reseau","tag-windows"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/247","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microcl